{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Entrorxia is a turn-based space 4X strategy game with distinctive resource management in which the player takes on the role of one of 12 asymmetrical species competing to conquer the galaxy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484960/extras/9ea4bb11a17c16ac2aa3fc6c62a98503.poster.avif?t=1761925425\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484960/extras/9ea4bb11a17c16ac2aa3fc6c62a98503.webm?t=1761925425\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484960/extras/9ea4bb11a17c16ac2aa3fc6c62a98503.mp4?t=1761925425\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484960/extras/759500c1d78e21eded784cc21f57f17c.avif?t=1761925425\" alt=\"Create an empire!\" width=600 height=58 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Therefore, you create a thriving civilization by mining raw materials to construct ever larger buildings on your way to rule. Mining and processing the right resources at the right time is a particularly important strategic aspect of the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484960/extras/1b193af32fec2abe43a7ef346272f67a.poster.avif?t=1761925425\" width=800 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484960/extras/1b193af32fec2abe43a7ef346272f67a.webm?t=1761925425\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484960/extras/1b193af32fec2abe43a7ef346272f67a.mp4?t=1761925425\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484960/extras/f4eac2bb6f2a53f80ef6c552fbdf17d0.avif?t=1761925425\" alt=\"Exploit planets!\" width=600 height=58 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A variety of building upgrades and the development of ever new sources of resources will help you to slowly transform yourself from a nation of constant scarcity to one of prosperity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484960/extras/958347834799a5a986653f593969d2d6.poster.avif?t=1761925425\" width=800 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484960/extras/958347834799a5a986653f593969d2d6.webm?t=1761925425\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484960/extras/958347834799a5a986653f593969d2d6.mp4?t=1761925425\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484960/extras/7c30aec942ddf34213ebaa7cd23c1449.avif?t=1761925425\" alt=\"Your decisions count!\" width=600 height=58 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So do you prefer to process the resources you gain into ever higher quality products to generate great prosperity, or do you first invest them in further expansion and even greater dominance? No matter what you decide in the end, a sprawling technology tree is always at your side... Or do you explore the anomalies on your planets first to get special and unique bonuses?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484960/extras/2d7eed327c8b445533d4261c85c8bb27.poster.avif?t=1761925425\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484960/extras/2d7eed327c8b445533d4261c85c8bb27.webm?t=1761925425\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484960/extras/2d7eed327c8b445533d4261c85c8bb27.mp4?t=1761925425\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484960/extras/4b52f4d6de356fcc9ad07d0f6f274eb9.avif?t=1761925425\" alt=\"Manage a living universe!\" width=600 height=58 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But with new goods come new challenges, such as horrendous energy consumption, pollution and, of course, the citizens. Because in Entrorxia you don't just manage a sterile empire, but try to lead and provide for a constantly growing population. Grow citizens to unleash the full potential of your buildings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484960/extras/6ed580969e2137ff64c7d5dd1a1fbddf.poster.avif?t=1761925425\" width=800 height=364 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484960/extras/6ed580969e2137ff64c7d5dd1a1fbddf.webm?t=1761925425\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484960/extras/6ed580969e2137ff64c7d5dd1a1fbddf.mp4?t=1761925425\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484960/extras/00a94cfda7dd64e7da41318d235749a8.avif?t=1761925425\" alt=\"Defy challenges!\" width=600 height=58 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But with every citizen comes challenges, so make sure they are happy and deal with their political views by promoting or suppressing parties to benefit from their bonuses and keep your citizens happy. Because only with happy individuals will your empire ultimately develop its full economic potential and manage to mature into a true empire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484960/extras/75665e893d493bebcb09db8e724c1946.poster.avif?t=1761925425\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484960/extras/75665e893d493bebcb09db8e724c1946.webm?t=1761925425\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484960/extras/75665e893d493bebcb09db8e724c1946.mp4?t=1761925425\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484960/extras/97fe98ec05ff16304a5885d8b3b02a5c.avif?t=1761925425\" alt=\"And crush your enemies!\" width=600 height=58 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But to do this, you must also expand your empire beyond the borders of the starting systems by competing with other players for newly discovered systems and securing your supremacy with your warships. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Because ultimately we have to decide whether those out there are friends or foes. Whether we want to achieve victory with or despite them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So join forces with like-minded people to expand your economy and destroy those who envy your success in epic spaceship battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484960/extras/f2d38408175b6877ee4cee40abc44490.poster.avif?t=1761925425\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484960/extras/f2d38408175b6877ee4cee40abc44490.webm?t=1761925425\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484960/extras/f2d38408175b6877ee4cee40abc44490.mp4?t=1761925425\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484960/extras/6b5af96a8ba44af232fc7fb488fd4225.avif?t=1761925425\" alt=\"Features:\" width=603 height=58 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >12 asymmetric species</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >300+ technologies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >150+ different hexagon types</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >250+ buildings / building upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >complex politics and market system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >versatile spaceships and epic space battles</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you prevail, or will you perish from the maelstrom of greed?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Either way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484960/extras/94d410049f0b19d4d6d4c31e8bb7dff4.webp?t=1761925425\" alt=\"Entrotria awaits you!\" width=600 height=58 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3484960?t=1761925425","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3484960?t=1761925425","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484960/c713762d070bf3c877c9028b597d19f108590c0b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761925425","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484960/c713762d070bf3c877c9028b597d19f108590c0b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761925425","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"HDR available","id":61},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Entrorxia is a turn-based space 4X strategy game with distinctive resource management in which the player takes on the role of one of 12 asymmetrical species competing to conquer the galaxy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484960/extras/9ea4bb11a17c16ac2aa3fc6c62a98503.poster.avif?t=1761925425\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484960/extras/9ea4bb11a17c16ac2aa3fc6c62a98503.webm?t=1761925425\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484960/extras/9ea4bb11a17c16ac2aa3fc6c62a98503.mp4?t=1761925425\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484960/extras/759500c1d78e21eded784cc21f57f17c.avif?t=1761925425\" alt=\"Create an empire!\" width=600 height=58 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Therefore, you create a thriving civilization by mining raw materials to construct ever larger buildings on your way to rule. Mining and processing the right resources at the right time is a particularly important strategic aspect of the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484960/extras/1b193af32fec2abe43a7ef346272f67a.poster.avif?t=1761925425\" width=800 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484960/extras/1b193af32fec2abe43a7ef346272f67a.webm?t=1761925425\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484960/extras/1b193af32fec2abe43a7ef346272f67a.mp4?t=1761925425\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484960/extras/f4eac2bb6f2a53f80ef6c552fbdf17d0.avif?t=1761925425\" alt=\"Exploit planets!\" width=600 height=58 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A variety of building upgrades and the development of ever new sources of resources will help you to slowly transform yourself from a nation of constant scarcity to one of prosperity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484960/extras/958347834799a5a986653f593969d2d6.poster.avif?t=1761925425\" width=800 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484960/extras/958347834799a5a986653f593969d2d6.webm?t=1761925425\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484960/extras/958347834799a5a986653f593969d2d6.mp4?t=1761925425\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484960/extras/7c30aec942ddf34213ebaa7cd23c1449.avif?t=1761925425\" alt=\"Your decisions count!\" width=600 height=58 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So do you prefer to process the resources you gain into ever higher quality products to generate great prosperity, or do you first invest them in further expansion and even greater dominance? No matter what you decide in the end, a sprawling technology tree is always at your side... Or do you explore the anomalies on your planets first to get special and unique bonuses?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484960/extras/2d7eed327c8b445533d4261c85c8bb27.poster.avif?t=1761925425\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484960/extras/2d7eed327c8b445533d4261c85c8bb27.webm?t=1761925425\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484960/extras/2d7eed327c8b445533d4261c85c8bb27.mp4?t=1761925425\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484960/extras/4b52f4d6de356fcc9ad07d0f6f274eb9.avif?t=1761925425\" alt=\"Manage a living universe!\" width=600 height=58 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But with new goods come new challenges, such as horrendous energy consumption, pollution and, of course, the citizens. Because in Entrorxia you don't just manage a sterile empire, but try to lead and provide for a constantly growing population. Grow citizens to unleash the full potential of your buildings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484960/extras/6ed580969e2137ff64c7d5dd1a1fbddf.poster.avif?t=1761925425\" width=800 height=364 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484960/extras/6ed580969e2137ff64c7d5dd1a1fbddf.webm?t=1761925425\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484960/extras/6ed580969e2137ff64c7d5dd1a1fbddf.mp4?t=1761925425\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484960/extras/00a94cfda7dd64e7da41318d235749a8.avif?t=1761925425\" alt=\"Defy challenges!\" width=600 height=58 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But with every citizen comes challenges, so make sure they are happy and deal with their political views by promoting or suppressing parties to benefit from their bonuses and keep your citizens happy. Because only with happy individuals will your empire ultimately develop its full economic potential and manage to mature into a true empire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484960/extras/75665e893d493bebcb09db8e724c1946.poster.avif?t=1761925425\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484960/extras/75665e893d493bebcb09db8e724c1946.webm?t=1761925425\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484960/extras/75665e893d493bebcb09db8e724c1946.mp4?t=1761925425\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484960/extras/97fe98ec05ff16304a5885d8b3b02a5c.avif?t=1761925425\" alt=\"And crush your enemies!\" width=600 height=58 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But to do this, you must also expand your empire beyond the borders of the starting systems by competing with other players for newly discovered systems and securing your supremacy with your warships. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Because ultimately we have to decide whether those out there are friends or foes. Whether we want to achieve victory with or despite them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So join forces with like-minded people to expand your economy and destroy those who envy your success in epic spaceship battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484960/extras/f2d38408175b6877ee4cee40abc44490.poster.avif?t=1761925425\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484960/extras/f2d38408175b6877ee4cee40abc44490.webm?t=1761925425\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484960/extras/f2d38408175b6877ee4cee40abc44490.mp4?t=1761925425\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484960/extras/6b5af96a8ba44af232fc7fb488fd4225.avif?t=1761925425\" alt=\"Features:\" width=603 height=58 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >12 asymmetric species</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >300+ technologies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >150+ different hexagon types</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >250+ buildings / building upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >complex politics and market system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >versatile spaceships and epic space battles</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you prevail, or will you perish from the maelstrom of greed?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Either way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484960/extras/94d410049f0b19d4d6d4c31e8bb7dff4.webp?t=1761925425\" alt=\"Entrotria awaits you!\" width=600 height=58 /></span></p>","developers":["Simon Alber"],"genres":[{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484960/c9ab344dd64f9737089db0599a2c415e5df883e9/header.jpg?t=1761925425","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3484960/1604353016/4f4301e97f569e99b70fd1918452ac8a254e3c2e/1761924312/dash_av1.mpd?t=1761925424","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3484960/1604353016/4f4301e97f569e99b70fd1918452ac8a254e3c2e/1761924312/dash_h264.mpd?t=1761925424","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3484960/1604353016/4f4301e97f569e99b70fd1918452ac8a254e3c2e/1761924312/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1761925424","id":257112485,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akama